---
title:    "A Functional-Logic Perspective on Parsing"
citation: "(FLOPS 1999)"
#old broken link: http://www.springer.de/comp/lncs/ (in Springer LNCS 1722)
url:      "https://doi.org/10.1007/10705424_6"
date:     1999-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper describes the design of a library for building parsers
where the functional and logic features are exploited.
This library is available in the
[Curry package fl-parser](https://cpm.curry-lang.org/pkgs/fl-parser.html).